  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 18 - 23 × 455 ÷ 7 + 28 = 377\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) + and ×\n\n18 - 23 × 455 ÷ 7 + 28 = 377 ⇒ 18 - 23 + 455 ÷ 7 × 28 = 377\n\n⇒ 18 - 23 + __**455 ÷ 7**__ × 28 = 377\n\n⇒ 18 - 23 + __**65 **____**×**____** 28**__ = 377\n\n⇒ __**18 + 1820**__ - 23 = 377\n\n⇒ __1838** - 23**__ = 377\n\n⇒ 1815 ≠ 377 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) − and ×\n\n18 - 23 × 455 ÷ 7 + 28 = 377 ⇒ 18 × 23 - 455 ÷ 7 + 28 = 377\n\n⇒ 18 × 23 - __**455 ÷ 7**__ + 28 = 377\n\n⇒ __**18 **____**×**____** 23**__ - 65 + 28 = 377\n\n⇒ __414 + 28__ - 65 = 377\n\n⇒ __442 - 65__ = 377\n\n**⇒ 377 = 377 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) − and +\n\n18 - 23 × 455 ÷ 7 + 28 = 377 ⇒ 18 + 23 × 455 ÷ 7 - 28 = 377\n\n⇒ 18 + 23 × __**455 ÷ 7**__ - 28 = 377\n\n⇒ 18 + __**23 × 65**__ - 28 = 377\n\n⇒ __18 + 1495__ - 28 = 377\n\n⇒ __1513 - 28__ = 377\n\n⇒ 1485 ≠ 377 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) ÷ and −\n\n18 - 23 × 455 ÷ 7 + 28 = 377 ⇒ 18 ÷ 23 × 455 - 7 + 28 = 377\n\n⇒ __**18 ÷**____** 23**__ × 455 - 7 + 28 = 377\n\n⇒ __**0.78**____** × 455**__ - 7 + 28 = 377\n\n⇒ __354.9 + 28__ - 7 = 377\n\n⇒ __382.9 - 7__ = 377\n\n⇒ 375.9 ≠ 377 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
